  "takeaway": "Boston led by 17 in the first half, but eight straight third-quarter turnovers fed a 12–0 Denver run, and Jamal Murray's jumper with 6.4 seconds left sealed a 105–101 Nuggets win. It is the Celtics' first losing streak of the season.",
